dolphin-insync-plugin (1.0.1-1) noble; urgency=medium

  * Add defensive null checks on QPointer<QLocalSocket> arguments
    to prevent crashes when the socket has already been destroyed.
  * Remove redundant manual delete on a Qt-parented socket.
  * Replace heap-allocated socket in getFileStatus with a
    stack-allocated one (RAII, exception-safe).
  * Drop the unused controlSocketPath member that was shadowed by
    a local variable.
  * Add Doxygen documentation for public classes, enums and methods.
  * Add VERSION/SOVERSION to libinsyncdolphinpluginhelper.
  * Add build.sh that compiles the project and produces the .deb.

 -- Olivier Booklage <obooklagek@gmail.com>  Fri, 08 May 2026 12:52:42 +0200

dolphin-insync-plugin (1.0.0-1) noble; urgency=medium

  * Initial Debian packaging.
  * Fix memory leak in sendCommand (heap to stack allocation).
  * Fix uninitialized helper pointer (value member instead of raw pointer).
  * Fix TRANSLATION_DOMAIN redefinition warnings (per-target definitions).

 -- Olivier Booklage <obooklagek@gmail.com>  Sun, 06 Apr 2026 10:00:00 +0200
